      "id": "sosp:sosp-2026:janusmultillmservingatproductionscale",
      "title": "Janus: Multi-LLM Serving at Production Scale",
      "abstract": "Janus is a production multi-LLM serving system that separates service-level model placement from engine-level memory management. It combines a slower steady-state scheduler with a faster elasticity loop and virtualizes device memory through xTensor so colocated models can share accelerators while respecting service objectives.",
